      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: "- 'New Loop' \u2192 play notes \u2192 press again to stop. \n- 'New
        Loop' while loops are playing \u2192 all existing loops finish \u2192 playback
        stops \u2192 your cue to play \u2192 play notes \u2192 press again to stop.
        The new loop is added to the end of the sequence.\n- 'Overdub' \u2192 play
        notes over exisiting loop \u2192 press again to stop."
